{
  "name": "editor-blocks",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Editor Blocks — a library of ready-to-use, drop-in editor modules for React and Next.js. Each module is a pre-tuned editor configuration for one job (comments, articles, documents, presentations) with its extension set, toolbar, and constraints already decided. Engine-agnostic by design: the first release ships four modules powered by TipTap, with Lexical, ProseMirror, and others on the roadmap.",
